flowchart LR
    S([START]) --> P

    subgraph STATE["Shared graph state: transcript, turns, one slice per node, errors, mode"]
        direction LR
        P[prepare_transcript] --> L[classify_language]
        L --> I[classify_intent]
        I --> SE[analyse_sentiment]
        SE --> R[assess_resolution]
        R --> E[extract_evidence]
        E --> RC[analyse_root_cause]
        RC --> RK[predict_risks]
        RK --> A[recommend_action]
        A --> K[detect_knowledge_gaps]
        K --> SS[summarise_and_score]
    end

    SS --> V{validate_output<br/>Pydantic schema<br/>+ verbatim evidence}
    V -->|valid| END([END: Analysis record])
    V -.->|invalid in live mode:<br/>retry the failing node once| STATE
    V -->|still invalid| ERR([END: record with errors noted])

    MODE{{Each node runs in one of two modes}}
    MODE -.-> LIVE[live: prompt + chat model<br/>structured output]
    MODE -.-> REPLAY[replay: slice from<br/>reviewed analysis.json]
